1
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:06,444
Namaskaar doston, aur swagat hai aapka is channel par.

2
00:00:06,694 --> 00:00:17,729
Aaj hum banayenge ek complete, professional Sales MIS Report —
bilkul usi tarah jaise companies mein MIS executives banate hain.

3
00:00:17,979 --> 00:00:29,185
MIS ka matlab hai Management Information System — raw data ko aise
summarise karna ki management ek nazar mein decision le sake.

4
00:00:29,435 --> 00:00:39,915
Video ke end tak aapke paas hoga ek live dashboard — KPIs,
region aur product analysis, Pivot Tables, charts aur slicers.

5
00:00:40,165 --> 00:00:46,401
Main sirf dikhaunga nahi, har formula
samjhaunga bhi. Toh chaliye shuru karte hain!

6
00:00:46,651 --> 00:00:56,642
Sabse pehle data samajhte hain. Yeh Raw_Data sheet
hai — isme October 2026 ki 180 transactions hain.

7
00:00:56,892 --> 00:01:05,090
Date invoice ki tareekh hai, Invoice No har bill ka
unique number, aur Region — East, West, North ya South.

8
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:13,047
Phir Salesperson, Product — Tea A, Tea B ya Tea
C, Qty yaani kitne units bike, aur Unit Price.

9
00:01:13,297 --> 00:01:22,072
Sales Amount abhi khaali hai — ise hum formula se
bharenge. Aur Payment Status batata hai — Paid ya Pending.

10
00:01:22,322 --> 00:01:35,408
Shortcut: Ctrl + ↓ — cursor seedha aakhri row
182 par. Yaani header ke neeche 180 data rows.

11
00:01:35,658 --> 00:01:46,182
Important: ek row = ek unique invoice. Har Invoice
No bhara hua hai aur kabhi repeat nahi hota.

12
00:01:46,432 --> 00:01:57,831
Ab is data ko Excel Table mein convert karte hain — formulas
readable bante hain aur range apne aap expand hoti hai.

13
00:01:58,081 --> 00:02:03,164
Data ke kisi bhi cell par click karke Ctrl + T dabaiye.

14
00:02:03,414 --> 00:02:14,644
Create Table mein range =$A$2:$I$182 aa gayi. 'My
table has headers' tick hona chahiye — phir OK.

15
00:02:14,894 --> 00:02:24,672
Table ban gaya — banded rows, har header par
filter button, aur ribbon mein Table Design tab.

16
00:02:24,922 --> 00:02:33,377
Table Name box mein likhiye SalesData aur Enter.
Yahi naam aage har formula mein use hoga.

17
00:02:33,627 --> 00:02:43,682
Ab Sales Amount. Table ke andar formulas structured references
use karte hain — cell address nahi, column ka naam.

18
00:02:43,932 --> 00:02:54,946
H3 mein type kijiye: =[@Qty]*[@[Unit Price]]

19
00:02:55,196 --> 00:03:04,718
@ ka matlab — isi row ki value. Unit Price do shabdon
ka naam hai, isliye uske around double brackets.

20
00:03:04,968 --> 00:03:13,486
Enter dabaate hi formula poore column mein
apne aap fill — saari 180 rows ek saath.

21
00:03:13,736 --> 00:03:27,652
Check: row 3 mein 55 × 120.00 = 6,600.00 ✔. Column
select karein toh status bar mein Sum: 1,428,190.00.

22
00:03:27,902 --> 00:03:36,549
Ab dashboard ka dil — KPI cards. Yaad rakhiye,
final values kabhi haath se type nahi karte.

23
00:03:36,799 --> 00:03:43,503
Sab kuch formula se aata hai — data
badla, toh number apne aap update.

24
00:03:43,753 --> 00:03:59,697
Total Sales (B6): SUMIFS sirf October ka Sales
Amount jodta hai — date range DATE() se di hai.

25
00:03:59,947 --> 00:04:04,923
Result: 1,428,190.00 — yaani chaudah
lakh, atthais hazaar, ek sau nabbe.

26
00:04:05,173 --> 00:04:16,232
Total Orders (D6): ek row = ek invoice, isliye
COUNTIFS se October ke non-blank invoices — 180.

27
00:04:16,482 --> 00:04:26,005
Total Units Sold (F6): wahi date
condition, Qty ka SUMIFS — 11,834.

28
00:04:26,255 --> 00:04:41,837
Average Sales / Order (H6): =IFERROR(B6/D6,0) —
orders zero hon toh bhi error nahi. Result 7,934.39.

29
00:04:42,087 --> 00:04:55,173
Pending Sales Amount (B9): Payment Status
= "Pending" wala SUMIFS — 372,985.00.

30
00:04:55,423 --> 00:05:08,422
Naam jaan-boojhkar Pending Sales Amount rakha hai, 'Outstanding Receivables'
nahi — data mein payment received ya balance ki field hi nahi hai.

31
00:05:08,672 --> 00:05:16,210
Ab region-wise analysis — management
dekhna chahta hai kaunsa region aage hai.

32
00:05:16,460 --> 00:05:29,032
C13 mein wahi SUMIFS + ek condition: SalesData[Region] = B13.
Region cell se aata hai, isliye formula neeche copy ho jaata hai.

33
00:05:29,282 --> 00:05:47,873
East 351,030 • West 383,675 (sabse
strong) • North 355,130 • South 338,355.

34
00:05:48,123 --> 00:05:58,306
Total (C17) = 1,428,190.00 — bilkul Total
Sales ke barabar. Yahi hamara cross-check hai ✔

35
00:05:58,556 --> 00:06:10,190
Isi tarah Product-wise: Tea A 385,320 • Tea B 432,820
• Tea C 610,050 — total phir se 1,428,190.00 ✔

36
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:17,102
Formulas ke saath Pivot Table bhi seekhte
hain — drag-and-drop se instant summary.

37
00:06:17,352 --> 00:06:25,102
SalesData ke kisi cell par click →
Insert → PivotTable → From Table/Range.

38
00:06:25,352 --> 00:06:32,762
Table/Range mein SalesData already aa
gaya. New Worksheet choose karke OK.

39
00:06:33,012 --> 00:06:44,560
Nayi sheet bani — right side PivotTable Fields. Region
ko Rows mein, Sales Amount ko Values mein drag kijiye.

40
00:06:44,810 --> 00:06:55,804
Dhyaan: Values mein Sum of Sales Amount hona chahiye.
'Count of' dikhe toh → Value Field Settings → Sum.

41
00:06:56,054 --> 00:07:08,008
Date ko Filters mein daaliye, October 2026 rakhiye.
Grand Total = 1428190 — dashboard se match ✔

42
00:07:08,258 --> 00:07:15,368
Isi tarah doosra pivot — Product
Rows mein, Sales Amount Values mein.

43
00:07:15,618 --> 00:07:22,109
Ab charts — visuals se management
ko baat turant samajh aati hai.

44
00:07:22,359 --> 00:07:30,727
Region pivot select → PivotTable Analyze
→ PivotChart → Clustered Column → OK.

45
00:07:30,977 --> 00:07:42,825
Chart aa gaya. Right-click → Add Data Labels — har bar
par exact value. Title: Region-wise Sales Performance.

46
00:07:43,075 --> 00:07:53,259
Product pivot ke liye Pie chart — Product-wise
Sales Analysis. Tea C ka share sabse bada.

47
00:07:53,509 --> 00:07:58,613
Ab report ko interactive banate hain — slicers se.

48
00:07:58,863 --> 00:08:06,890
Pivot select → PivotTable Analyze → Insert
Slicer → Region aur Product tick → OK.

49
00:08:07,140 --> 00:08:18,538
Ek slicer se dono pivots: slicer par right-click
→ Report Connections → dono PivotTables tick.

50
00:08:18,788 --> 00:08:26,879
Yaad rakhiye: slicer sirf same data source
(SalesData) wale pivots ko jod sakta hai.

51
00:08:27,129 --> 00:08:34,175
Ab West par click — dono pivots aur charts
turant West ke liye filter ho gaye!

52
00:08:34,425 --> 00:08:41,812
Filter hatane ke liye slicer ka Clear
Filter button — totals wapas poore.

53
00:08:42,062 --> 00:08:50,346
Ab finishing — professional dashboard
ka matlab decoration nahi, clarity.

54
00:08:50,596 --> 00:09:00,522
Bold title, KPI cards ka consistent colour, aur
numbers par thousands separator — Ctrl + Shift + 1.

55
00:09:00,772 --> 00:09:07,092
View tab → Gridlines untick — look ekdum clean.

56
00:09:07,342 --> 00:09:15,968
Ek font, consistent spacing, do-teen colours —
report manager ke liye hai, readability sabse upar.

57
00:09:16,218 --> 00:09:23,946
Report tab tak bharosemand nahi jab
tak refresh aur validation na ho.

58
00:09:24,196 --> 00:09:33,354
Raw_Data mein nayi row aaye — Table hone se
SUMIFS / COUNTIFS use apne aap pakad lete hain.

59
00:09:33,604 --> 00:09:43,060
Pivot Tables ko refresh karna padta hai:
Data → Refresh All — ya Ctrl + Alt + F5.

60
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:53,364
Teen cross-check: Region total = Product total
= Pivot Grand Total = Total Sales 1,428,190.

61
00:09:53,614 --> 00:09:59,316
Teeno match ✔ — report reconciled.

62
00:09:59,566 --> 00:10:05,566
Toh doston, aaj humne zero se ek
complete Sales MIS Report banayi.

63
00:10:05,816 --> 00:10:16,808
Excel Table, structured formula, SUMIFS / COUNTIFS KPIs,
region-product analysis, Pivot, charts aur slicers.

64
00:10:17,058 --> 00:10:26,516
Aur sabse zaroori — har number ko validate kiya.
Yahi aapko professional MIS executive banata hai.

65
00:10:26,766 --> 00:10:39,402
Video achhi lagi toh Like, Subscribe aur comment
mein agla topic bataiye. Happy Excel-ing!
